## 📊 Dataset

The dataset used in this project focuses on **Electric Vehicle (EV) Adoption and Charging Infrastructure Analysis**. It supports the exploration of EV adoption trends, charging infrastructure availability, and related patterns through interactive Power BI dashboards.

### 🔗 Dataset Access
The dataset is available on Kaggle:

👉 Access the Dataset on Kaggle: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/shubhampatil75/ev-adoption-and-charging-infrastructure-analysis

### 📌 How to Use
1. Open the Kaggle dataset using the link above.
2. Download the dataset files.
3. Open the Power BI `.pbix` file provided in this repository.
4. If required, update the data source path in Power BI to match your downloaded files.
5. Explore the dashboard visuals, filters, and insights.

*Note: Please refer to the Kaggle dataset page for information about the data source, columns, and usage permissions.*
